## 1. Task evidence

### T073 — Security audit (FR-015): VERIFIED

The audit is codified as a reproducible script and a narrative doc:

- `scripts/ci/security_audit.sh` scans RBAC verbs/scopes (no wildcard verbs), Secret use
  (runtime generation, no static credentials in Git), TLS validation (gNMIc `skip-verify: false`
  + `tls-ca/tls-cert/tls-key` secretKeyRefs), image privileges (nonroot distroless controller
  images), Docker/KVM trust boundaries (preflight enforcement), Grafana plugin provenance
  (digest-pinned install), anonymous access/default credentials
  (`GF_AUTH_ANONYMOUS_ENABLED` false, credentials generated at runtime by Job), and log/status
  redaction (no secret-value logging patterns). It prints `SECURITY_AUDIT_OK` on pass.
  Slice: `gates/proofs/scripts.ci.security_audit.sh.full.slice.txt`.
- Fresh run (2026-09-01 06:10Z): `gates/proofs/security-audit.run.log` →
  `SECURITY_AUDIT_OK`, `security-audit rc=0`.
- Narrative: `docs/SECURITY_AUDIT_T073.md`
  (slice: `gates/proofs/docs.SECURITY_AUDIT_T073.md.full.slice.txt`).
- Backing artifacts (all cited, slices staged): `config/rbac/` (slice
  `gates/proofs/config.rbac.all.slice.txt`), `deploy/rbac/secret-generator-job.yaml`
  (idempotent credentials/TLS generation; slice
  `gates/proofs/deploy.rbac.secret-generator-job.yaml.full.slice.txt`),
  `deploy/gnmi/gnmic.yaml` (`skip-verify: false` + TLS/creds secretKeyRefs; slice
  `gates/proofs/deploy.gnmi.gnmic.yaml.tls-creds.slice.txt`),
  `deploy/observability/grafana.yaml` (`GF_AUTH_ANONYMOUS_ENABLED` false, digest-pinned
  `GF_INSTALL_PLUGINS`; slice `gates/proofs/deploy.observability.grafana.yaml.auth.slice.txt`),
  `deploy/observability/grafana-secret-generator-job.yaml` (slice
  `gates/proofs/deploy.observability.grafana-secret-generator-job.yaml.full.slice.txt`),
  `deploy/ainetops/manifests/provider.yaml` and `deploy/ainetops/manifests/srv6-controller.yaml`
  (nonroot securityContext; slices `gates/proofs/deploy.ainetops.manifests.provider.yaml.security.slice.txt`,
  `gates/proofs/deploy.ainetops.manifests.srv6-controller.yaml.security.slice.txt`),
  `cmd/sonic-provider/Dockerfile` + `cmd/srv6-controller/Dockerfile` (distroless nonroot; slices
  `gates/proofs/cmd.sonic-provider.Dockerfile.full.slice.txt`,
  `gates/proofs/cmd.srv6-controller.Dockerfile.full.slice.txt`),
