### T076 — `scripts/provision.sh` complete ordered workflow: VERIFIED

- Implementation: `scripts/provision.sh` — documented flags `--profile`, `--cluster-name`,
  `--timeout` (lines 20–34; slice `gates/proofs/scripts.provision.sh.flags.slice.txt`); ordered
  non-interactive idempotent phases preflight → pins/CRD validation → owned Docker network →
  Kind → containerlab → in-cluster applications → SDC/fabric seed → generated topology assets →
  SRv6Service apply → readiness → capability gate (slices
  `gates/proofs/scripts.provision.sh.ordered-phases.slice.txt`,
  `gates/proofs/scripts.provision.sh.apps.slice.txt`); fail-closed gate behavior: on gate
  failure for `sonic-vs` it prints
  `[provision] sonic-vs failed gate; this profile is not SRv6-qualified. Use --profile sonic-vm for conformance.`
  and exits 1 (lines 181–186; slice `gates/proofs/scripts.provision.sh.srv6-gate.slice.txt`).
- Runtime proof (3×): `gates/proofs/cycles/provision-1.log`, `provision-2.log`, `provision-3.log`
  (exit=0 each). Each shows: six deployments `successfully rolled out`
  (otel-collector, gnmic, prometheus, grafana, ainetops-sonic-provider, ainetops-srv6-controller);
  `[assert-crds] OK` (provision-1 line 371, provision-2 line 360, provision-3 line 361); the full
  capability gate executing Capabilities/Get/Set/Subscribe/sonic-srv6/persistence/EVPN-Type2/3/5/
  SRv6-Underlay/H.Encaps.Red/End/End.DT46/SID-list/Decapsulation/Counters with no skipped
  capability → `[qualify] OK` (provision-1 line 649, provision-2 line 656, provision-3 line 658);
  `[provision] complete: pins verified, CRDs validated/asserted, Kind ensured/attached, lab
  deployed, apps installed, seed applied, capability gate executed.` (provision-1 line 651).
  Slices: `gates/proofs/cycles.provision-{1,2,3}.key.proof.txt`,
  `gates/proofs/cycles.provision-1.qualify-section.slice.txt` (gate section verbatim, lines 543–651).
- The fail-when-not-SRv6-qualified path is demonstrated live by the conformance run
  (`gates/proofs/cycles/provision-conformance.log`, exit=1 — see T080).

