## 2. Success criteria evidence (SC-001 – SC-016)

Criterion text: `specs/001-ainetops-sonic-evpn-fabric/spec.md` "Success Criteria *(mandatory)*"
(slice `gates/proofs/spec.md.success-criteria.slice.txt`).

### SC-001 — PARTIALLY VERIFIED
"the reference lab deploys all eight nodes and all SDC targets reach Ready using only the
documented quickstart."
- EIGHT NODES: VERIFIED — every `off-N.log` shows all 8 lab containers
  `clab-ainetops-fabric-{client01,client02,srv6-client01,srv6-client02,leaf01,leaf02,spine01,spine02}`
  `Removed` (slice `gates/proofs/cycles.off-1.proof.txt`); topology: `lab/topology.clab.yml`.
  Deployed via the documented quickstart command (`./scripts/provision.sh --profile sonic-vs
  --cluster-name ainetops`, `specs/001-ainetops-sonic-evpn-fabric/quickstart.md` §1) — exactly
  what `run_provision` executes (`gates/proofs/tests.integration.cycles_runner.sh.sections.slice.txt`).
- TARGETS READY: the two SDC-managed leaf targets (172.31.0.21/.22:8080) are qualified live by
  the capability gate (Capabilities/Get/Set/Subscribe/persistence/EVPN/SRv6 suites, `[qualify] OK`
  in `provision-{1,2,3}.log`). NOT demonstrated: SDC Target CR readiness through the in-cluster
  SDC data plane — `provision-1.log` line 302 records
  `[sdc-install] CRDs applied; 0/4 SDC component pods Ready within window; continuing best-effort`
  (root cause: FINDING 2 — placeholder upstream SDC images, `ImagePullBackOff` in
  `gates/proofs/cycles/runtime-inventory-kubectl-3.log`). All eight in-cluster AINETOPS-owned
  workloads ARE 1/1 Running per the same inventory (slice
